{"name": "Zombuds", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fifteen years after the outbreak, society is slowly crawling back to the Age of Abundance inside safe settlements. Outside the walls, zombies still haunt the loot-packed ruins, and desperate survivors risk their necks for a payday.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> <strong>But you're not here to survive the new world. You're here to own it.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get ready to provide  what people\u00a0<i>really</i> want in order to survive with a smile on their faces.\u00a0<i>No matter what it is.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Loot, manufacture and distribute a variety of questionable goods across a <strong>zombie-infested sandbox</strong> to become the baddest\u00a0<strong>apocalypse tycoon</strong> in this <i>open-world co-op sim</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"472\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4443350/extras/6389c5c24c96f23fa13d65c6afe6237f.poster.avif?t=1785777855\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4443350/extras/6389c5c24c96f23fa13d65c6afe6237f.webm?t=1785777855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4443350/extras/6389c5c24c96f23fa13d65c6afe6237f.mp4?t=1785777855\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a sprawling <strong>sandbox</strong> full of <strong>zombies</strong>, <strong>survivors</strong> and <strong>secrets</strong> in first or third person.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Scavenge</strong>, <strong>clear</strong> and <strong>claim</strong> a number of locations to turn them into <strong>profitable operations</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"472\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4443350/extras/8da0524adb4fb0a32b6e8487549a34ae.poster.avif?t=1785777855\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4443350/extras/8da0524adb4fb0a32b6e8487549a34ae.webm?t=1785777855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4443350/extras/8da0524adb4fb0a32b6e8487549a34ae.mp4?t=1785777855\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Produce <strong>drugs</strong>, <strong>meds</strong> and <strong>bizarre apocalyptic substances</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Every setup is yours to plan</strong>, so shape your rise in your own style.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"472\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4443350/extras/124555645c7b08a895f19590658b2287.poster.avif?t=1785777855\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4443350/extras/124555645c7b08a895f19590658b2287.webm?t=1785777855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4443350/extras/124555645c7b08a895f19590658b2287.mp4?t=1785777855\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hire <strong>desperate survivors</strong> to do your dirty work, or <strong>brainwash zombies</strong> into loyal servants.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Build</strong> and <strong>automate your empire</strong> from a local hustler to an <strong>international tycoon</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"472\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4443350/extras/591f0df2e1a5d1e7d959796bba7d8dbb.poster.avif?t=1785777855\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4443350/extras/591f0df2e1a5d1e7d959796bba7d8dbb.webm?t=1785777855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4443350/extras/591f0df2e1a5d1e7d959796bba7d8dbb.mp4?t=1785777855\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy <strong>ridiculous ways</strong> to take down the undead with an <strong>absurd arsenal</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buy and sell from the living: <strong>cars</strong>, <strong>clothes</strong>, <strong>weapons</strong>, <strong>drugs</strong> and much more.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"472\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4443350/extras/dfc42c4ff03c569258c7645dc0314ded.poster.avif?t=1785777855\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4443350/extras/dfc42c4ff03c569258c7645dc0314ded.webm?t=1785777855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4443350/extras/dfc42c4ff03c569258c7645dc0314ded.mp4?t=1785777855\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grab your human friends and scale your business together in <strong>co-op multiplayer</strong>.</p></li></ul> </div>", "short_desc": "You're not here to survive the apocalypse. You're here to own it. Loot, manufacture and distribute what people REALLY want across a zombie-infested sandbox. Grab your friends, brainwash the undead into workers, and become the baddest apocalypse tycoon.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4443350/dae3203e3e911b25a143ca81f41ae4bf72c4b655/header.jpg?t=1785777855", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Simulation", "Co-op", "Management", "Open World", "Zombies", "Shooter"], "developers": "Gamecraft Studios", "publishers": "Gamecraft Studios", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4443350", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "22 July 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/ny1ICDgtDTo", "first_seen": 1784671200.0, "review_rank": 238}